  "description": "FLC, carbon hard tails that are so light they almost disappear beneath you. The FLC Pro features Haro's exclusive M2X frame design platform, an innovative approach that combines oversized tapered head tube, massive downtube, and wider bb92 bottom bracket delivering a high level of torsional stiffness to optimize power transfer and utilizes super stiff unidirectional high modulus carbon fiber to deliver outstanding performance. FLC Pro is powered by a SRAM Eagle 12 speed 1X drive train and rolls along on an American Classic Onward 27.5 wheelset with sealed bearings and thru axle. Pro Features RockShox Reba RL tapered fork with 100mm of travel and Onelock remote lockout. FLC Pro stops on a dime thanks to Sram Guide RS disc brakeset with 180mm rear and 160mm front rotors. Also available in 29\" (see FLC 29 Pro)\nHaro FL Carbon Series frame, tapered head tube, BB92 shell, thru-axle\nRockShox Reba RL taper fork, 100mm travel, thru-axle, Onelock remote\n29\" frame, fork, hubs and crankset feature Boost specs\nRitchey WCS Logic Zero Drop-In headset w/ AC bearings\nSram X01 Eagle 34t crankset\nSram X01 Eagle 12-spd rear derailleur & Trigger shifter\nSram XG 1275 10-50T 12-spd cassette\nRitchey WCS cockpit and Lock-On grips\nRitchey WCS Streem V3 saddle\nAmerican Classic Onward 27.5\" wheelset, sealed bearings w/ thru-axles\nKenda Honey Badger XC 27.5\" x 2.2\" 120 TPI folding tires\nSram Guide RS 180 / 160mm disc brakeset",
